  "notes": "{及|およ}ぶ is an intransitive godan verb meaning to reach, extend to, or amount to.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive): {及|およ}ぶ - reaches/extends\n- {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive): {及|およ}ぼす - to exert (influence)\n\nPATTERN:\nXに{及|およ}ぶ: to reach/extend to X.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {及|およ}びません: no need / I can't compare (humble)\n- {及|およ}ばない: not necessary, unnecessary\n- {被害|ひがい}が{及|およ}ぶ: damage extends to\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {及|およ}び: and, as well as (formal conjunction)\n- {及|およ}ぼす: to exert, to have (effect on)\n- {言|い}{及|およ}ぶ: to mention, to refer to",
